  "summary": "<p>Just as President Donald J. Trump predicted, gas prices are tumbling down — and American families are feeling the relief just in time for Thanksgiving. From coast to coast, prices at the pump are falling fast, with the national average falling to its lowest price in eight months after the biggest three-week dive since 2008. [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/gas-prices-plunge-ahead-of-thanksgiving-just-as-president-trump-predicted/\">Gas Prices Plunge Ahead of Thanksgiving — Just as President Trump Predicted</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
